## Models & artifacts
## artifacts/ (isolation_forest.joblib + model_meta.json) IS committed on
## purpose: it's small (~2MB) and Fly.io's Docker build has no access to
## the multi-GB raw dataset needed to regenerate it. Regenerate locally
## via `python -m anomalock.models.train_serving_model` if it goes stale.
*.pkl
models/*.bin

